<title>JAPAN: F.C.C., Rico to set up clutch venture in India.</title>
<headline>F.C.C., Rico to set up clutch venture in India.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>F.C.C. Co Ltd said on Tuesday it has agreed with Rico Auto Industries Ltd of India to set up a joint venture to manufacture clutches in India.</p>
<p>The joint venture will be capitalised at 110 million rupees (330 million yen) and will be equally owned by the two companies, F.C.C. said in a statement.</p>
<p>The venture is expected to manufacture 240,000 clutches for motor bikes and 30,000 clutches for cars per year, the statement said.</p>
